# Cloudflare Pages _headers for Element Web
# Security headers: https://github.com/element-hq/element-web/blob/develop/apps/web/README.md#configuration-best-practices
# Caching rules:    https://github.com/element-hq/element-web/blob/develop/apps/web/README.md#caching-requirements

# Security headers applied to every response
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'

# These paths MUST NOT be cached, so a redeploy is picked up immediately
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/config.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/config.*.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/version
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/i18n/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
